Package: json-viewer
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: ARCH_PLACEHOLDER
Maintainer: Ricardo <your-email@example.com>
Description: Terminal-based JSON file viewer with query capabilities
 A fast, cross-platform command-line tool for browsing and viewing JSON files.
 Features include:
  - File browser with keyboard navigation
  - Plain text and hierarchical JSON views
  - JQL query support for filtering JSON data
  - Built with Rust for speed and reliability
